See AGENTS.md for complete documentation and .ai-context/skills/ for patterns.

## Before Writing MDL

1. Read relevant skill file: .ai-context/skills/write-microflows/SKILL.md or create-page/SKILL.md
2. Validate: ./mxcli check script.mdl -p project.mpr --references
3. Execute: ./mxcli exec script.mdl -p project.mpr

